{
  "id": "m31l2",
  "title": {
    "es": "Ordenación",
    "en": "Sorting"
  },
  "theory": {
    "es": [
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "value": "Poner en orden"
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "value": "Aunque en la práctica usarás `sorted()`, implementar una ordenación enseña mucho. La **ordenación burbuja** compara pares vecinos e intercambia hasta que todo queda en orden."
      },
      {
        "type": "code",
        "value": [
          "def burbuja(lista):",
          "    a = list(lista)",
          "    for i in range(len(a)):",
          "        for j in range(len(a) - 1 - i):",
          "            if a[j] > a[j + 1]:",
          "                a[j], a[j + 1] = a[j + 1], a[j]",
          "    return a",
          "",
          "print(burbuja([3, 1, 2]))"
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "output",
        "value": [
          "[1, 2, 3]"
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "note",
        "value": "Burbuja es O(n²): vale para aprender, pero para datos reales usa sorted() (mucho más rápido)."
      }
    ],
    "en": [
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "value": "Putting in order"
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "value": "Although in practice you'll use `sorted()`, implementing a sort teaches a lot. **Bubble sort** compares neighbouring pairs and swaps until everything is ordered."
      },
      {
        "type": "code",
        "value": [
          "def burbuja(lista):",
          "    a = list(lista)",
          "    for i in range(len(a)):",
          "        for j in range(len(a) - 1 - i):",
          "            if a[j] > a[j + 1]:",
          "                a[j], a[j + 1] = a[j + 1], a[j]",
          "    return a",
          "",
          "print(burbuja([3, 1, 2]))"
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "output",
        "value": [
          "[1, 2, 3]"
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "note",
        "value": "Bubble sort is O(n²): good for learning, but use sorted() for real data (far faster)."
      }
    ]
  },
  "exercises": [
    {
      "id": "m31l2e1",
      "prompt": {
        "es": "Define `burbuja(lista)` que devuelva una NUEVA lista ordenada (no modifiques la original).",
        "en": "Define `burbuja(lista)` returning a NEW sorted list (don't modify the original)."
      },
      "starter_code": [
        "def burbuja(lista):",
        "    pass"
      ],
      "solution": [
        "def burbuja(lista):",
        "    a = list(lista)",
        "    for i in range(len(a)):",
        "        for j in range(len(a) - 1 - i):",
        "            if a[j] > a[j + 1]:",
        "                a[j], a[j + 1] = a[j + 1], a[j]",
        "    return a"
      ],
      "hints": {
        "es": [
          "Copia con list(lista) y haz el doble bucle de burbuja."
        ],
        "en": [
          "Copy with list(lista) and do the bubble double loop."
        ]
      },
      "tests": [
        {
          "type": "function",
          "function": "burbuja",
          "cases": [
            {
              "args": [
                [
                  3,
                  1,
                  2
                ]
              ],
              "expected": [
                1,
                2,
                3
              ]
            },
            {
              "args": [
                [
                  5,
                  4,
                  3,
                  2,
                  1
                ]
              ],
              "expected": [
                1,
                2,
                3,
                4,
                5
              ]
            },
            {
              "args": [
                []
              ],
              "expected": []
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "m31l2e2",
      "prompt": {
        "es": "Define `insercion(lista)` (ordenación por inserción) que devuelva una nueva lista ordenada.",
        "en": "Define `insercion(lista)` (insertion sort) returning a new sorted list."
      },
      "starter_code": [
        "def insercion(lista):",
        "    pass"
      ],
      "solution": [
        "def insercion(lista):",
        "    a = list(lista)",
        "    for i in range(1, len(a)):",
        "        clave = a[i]",
        "        j = i - 1",
        "        while j >= 0 and a[j] > clave:",
        "            a[j + 1] = a[j]",
        "            j -= 1",
        "        a[j + 1] = clave",
        "    return a"
      ],
      "hints": {
        "es": [
          "Inserta cada elemento en su sitio dentro de la parte ya ordenada."
        ],
        "en": [
          "Insert each element into its place within the sorted part."
        ]
      },
      "tests": [
        {
          "type": "function",
          "function": "insercion",
          "cases": [
            {
              "args": [
                [
                  5,
                  2,
                  4,
                  1
                ]
              ],
              "expected": [
                1,
                2,
                4,
                5
              ]
            },
            {
              "args": [
                [
                  1
                ]
              ],
              "expected": [
                1
              ]
            },
            {
              "args": [
                [
                  3,
                  3,
                  1
                ]
              ],
              "expected": [
                1,
                3,
                3
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
